Linyaps Box Rust Debian packaging
================================

The package is built with dh-rust against crate source packages from the
Debian Cargo registry.  Cargo is configured by dh-rust to remain offline;
network downloads during the package build are not supported.

The feature-level Build-Depends list is the union of the direct external
dependencies declared by linyaps-box and the bundled libcontainer crate.  It
is kept in debian/control because apt must resolve build dependencies before
debian/rules can run.  Runtime shared-library dependencies and the Rust source
relationships in Built-Using are generated during the build.

The upstream source embeds the selected Youki libcontainer crate as a local
path dependency because it forms the implementation boundary of this runtime.
Its license is recorded separately in debian/copyright.  All of its external
Rust dependencies, and all other dependencies of linyaps-box, must be supplied
by the Debian librust-*-dev packages listed in debian/control.
